cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite both the dataset below and the accompanying manuscript."
type: dataset
title: "TAC-R2S2R verified GPU runs: 160 seeded runs of a controlled synthetic sim-to-real transfer proxy"
abstract: >-
  Seed-level metrics, per-epoch training logs and a verification script for 160 GPU runs
  (4 methods x 4 source-domain budgets x 10 seeds) of a synthetic binary grasp-and-place
  classification proxy used to evaluate the paired-consistency component of the TAC-R2S2R
  framework. The data are a controlled synthetic mechanism test and are not a physical-robot
  experiment, not a VLA policy training run, and not a complete Real2Sim2Real benchmark.
  The field `target_success_rate` is a legacy name for binary classification accuracy and
  does not denote robot task success.
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-12"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/lemonbaby2/tac-r2s2r-verified-runs"
keywords:
